msgid ""
"**The various connection configurations are shown below (FPort is used in "
"the diagrams, but just substitute SPort for the FPort labels in the images "
"when using SPort connections):**"
msgstr "**下面显示了各种连接配置（图中使用 FPort，但在使用 SPort 连接时，只需将图中的 FPort 标签替换为 SPort）：**"

