msgid "Connections"
msgstr "连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:30
#: c1929bbc5a614303bbdad06fb5502bc3
msgid "Fport: ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 23"
msgstr "Fport：``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 23"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:31
#: 08b45a3ad0304f5d8b3184d373598cfd
msgid "Sport: ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 10"
msgstr "Sport：``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:39
#: 3f00a0980c634624b73bfe58ae5d0ba1
msgid ""
"Fport: ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 23, ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 4 (Half Duplex)"
msgstr "Fport：``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 23，``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 4（半双工）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:40
#: b92158f51e6a4f1a8383cba3e1ecce9f
msgid ""
"Sport: ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 10, ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 4 (Half Duplex)"
msgstr "Sport：``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 10，``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 4（半双工）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:42
#: c880d66667334d3d80a9d1d8d5269915
msgid ""
"modifying the receiver to access the \"un-inverted\" signal may not have "
"enough drive, and/or, require the setting of the UART TX pin's pull-up "
"resistor. Try using ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 132 in that case."
msgstr ""
"修改接收机以访问「未反相」信号可能驱动能力不足，并且/或者需要设置 UART TX 引脚的上拉电阻。在这种情况下，请尝试使用 "
"``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 132。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:44
#: 67d32eb7b85240f8bba7d8e21d191be5
msgid ""
"getting an \"un-inverted\" SPort or FPort signal from some receivers by "
"tapping an internal connection may not provide enough drive for reliable "
"operation on some autopilots having protection resistors in series with "
"their UART pins, even when enabling the pull-up resistor on the UART. "
"Contact the autopilot OEM for possible workarounds or use an normal FPort "
"signal and external bi-directional inverter as shown above."
msgstr ""
"通过接入内部连接从某些接收机获取「未反相」SPort 或 FPort 信号，对于某些在其 UART 引脚上串联了保护电阻的飞控，即使启用 UART "
"的上拉电阻，也可能无法提供可靠操作所需的足够驱动能力。请联系飞控 OEM 寻求可能的解决方案，或使用上面所示的普通 FPort 信号和外部双向反相器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:52
#: 6db312e841634d1bafd70791d93f8c98
msgid "Fport: ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 23, ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 7"
msgstr "Fport：``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 23，``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:53
#: 2193c8e998724f4cb7309b8bef175360
msgid ""
"Sport: ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 10, ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 7 (invert TX/RX, "
"Half Duplex)"
msgstr "Sport：``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 10，``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 7（反转 TX/RX，半双工）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:57
#: 9fdd7c7cf6804abbaf86b6286de655f5
msgid ""
"F7/H7 boards can have the FPort connected to the UARTs RX pin, instead of "
"the TX pin as shown above, and use the UART's SWAP option. F4 boards do not "
"have this SWAP capability See :ref:`common-Fport-receivers` for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"F7/H7 板可以将 FPort 连接到 UART 的 RX 引脚，而不是上面显示的 TX 引脚，并使用 UART 的 SWAP 选项。F4 板没有此 "
"SWAP 功能，更多信息请参阅 :ref:`common-Fport-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:59
#: c596ea1b55cd46dea13d36eeb0a59703
msgid ""
"some autopilots, like the Cube Orange autopilot, have level shifters on "
"their UART pins used on their Telemetry ports. This requires a 10K pulldown "
"resistor externally on the receiver's SPort signal to work properly."
msgstr ""
"某些飞控（如 Cube Orange 飞控）的数传端口使用的 UART 引脚上有电平转换器。这需要在接收机的 SPort 信号上外接 10K "
"下拉电阻才能正常工作。"

